    {
     "say": "Once again we have an order block after a strong impulse.",
     "step": 0
    },
    {
     "say": "Price comes back and the entry is taken inside the zone.",
     "step": 1
    },
    {
     "say": "The stop goes below the low of the order block, with a little buffer. Gold often prints long wicks – a stop right at the edge gets taken out quickly.",
